  - talksprite: {fileID: -430271553, guid: 5660cfccf1c410749a95369164e607d3, type: 3}
    displayName: Eve L Minion 2
    textDelay: 0
    text: Yowzers, did you really have to hit us that hard, we make less than minimum
      wage.
  - talksprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2b3995ba25f61de4a96779dbeaa5d451, type: 3}
    displayName: Mallory
    textDelay: 0
    text: "Thank you young Hackwiz, I couldn\u2019t have defeated them. I\u2019m
      going to clean up this mess, and you should go home for now. I think Conius
      might want to see you."
